\import{base-macros}

\title{Disco}

\p{[Disco](https://github.com/disco-lang/disco) is a functional teaching language for discrete mathematics, implemented in Haskell.  Currently I'm working with [[heinrichapfelmus]] on building a basic web UI so students can use Disco in their browser.}

